Text_en:
They say we had an era of prosperity;
So why did inflation go up so much that many households removed meat and fruit from their tables and boycotted the market?
Let's read the history completely.

The two #terrorist #groups, Pahlavi and the hypocrites, are impure like oak sticks, they are not capable of peace, it is better to fight each other outside until they are destroyed.
This promise of God to destroy the enemies;
thank god

The end of 40 long-awaited years; 
The body of the martyr "Syed Javad Mousavi Haft Lang" was identified in Semiram, Isfahan province
He went to the front through the 192nd brigade and finally, on 2/04/1361, in the Ramadan operation in the area east of Basra/Kushk, he attained the high degree of martyrdom and was missing for years due to the conditions of the area.
